Step 1: Secrets setup first

Same order as last time: .gitignore containing .env is committed before any .env exists.

powershell
mkdir realtime-info-assistant
cd realtime-info-assistant
git init
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

.env.example (placeholders only):

OPENAI_API_KEY=your-llm-key-here
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=   (unset = OpenAI; set it only if you use a gateway)
EXCHANGERATE_API_KEY=your-exchangerate-key-here

Confirm git check-ignore -v .env prints a match. Install:

powershell
pip install langchain langchain-openai python-dotenv httpx pytest

requirements.txt (direct dependencies with floors and ceilings, saved as UTF-8):

langchain>=1.5,<2
